{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "PoYo AI - Flux 3 Video API",
    "description": "根据文本、图像、首尾帧、源视频或定位关键帧创建视频。",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.poyo.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "BearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/generate/submit": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "提交 Flux 3 视频任务",
        "operationId": "submitFlux3VideoTask",
        "tags": [
          "Flux 3"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "text-to-video": {
                  "summary": "文生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "flux-3/text-to-video",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "A red panda walks through a sunlit forest",
                      "duration": 5,
                      "resolution": "720p"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "image-to-video": {
                  "summary": "图生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "flux-3/image-to-video",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "The camera slowly moves closer",
                      "image_urls": [
                        "https://example.com/start.png"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "first-last-frame": {
                  "summary": "首尾帧",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "flux-3/first-last-frame-to-video",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "Transition smoothly between both scenes",
                      "duration": 5,
                      "image_urls": [
                        "https://example.com/start.png",
                        "https://example.com/end.png"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "extend-video": {
                  "summary": "延长视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "flux-3/extend-video",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "Continue tracking as the subject turns",
                      "video_url": "https://example.com/source.mp4"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "keyframes": {
                  "summary": "关键帧生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "flux-3/keyframes-to-video",
                    "input": {
                      "prompt": "Move smoothly through the keyframes",
                      "duration": 5,
                      "keyframes": [
                        {
                          "image_url": "https://example.com/frame-1.png",
                          "frame_index": 0
                        },
                        {
                          "image_url": "https://example.com/frame-2.png",
                          "frame_index": 120
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务已提交",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数无效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未授权：API Key 无效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "API Key",
        "description": "所有 API 接口都需要 Bearer Token 认证。\n\n创建 API Key：登录 PoYo，进入 **仪表盘 → API 密钥**（[poyo.ai/zh/dashboard/api-key](https://poyo.ai/zh/dashboard/api-key)），点击创建 Key。\n\n在请求头中添加：\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "SubmitRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "input"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "要使用的 Flux 3 工作流。所选模型决定必填的媒体输入字段。",
            "enum": [
              "flux-3/text-to-video",
              "flux-3/image-to-video",
              "flux-3/first-last-frame-to-video",
              "flux-3/extend-video",
              "flux-3/keyframes-to-video"
            ]
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "接收 finished 或 failed 结果的 Webhook URL。"
          },
          "input": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Flux3Input"
          }
        }
      },
      "Flux3Input": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "prompt"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "描述期望的场景、运动和镜头行为（所有 Flux 3 模型）。"
          },
          "duration": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 5,
            "maximum": 20,
            "default": 5,
            "description": "输出时长，单位为秒（所有 Flux 3 模型）。"
          },
          "resolution": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "720p",
              "1080p"
            ],
            "default": "720p",
            "description": "输出分辨率（所有 Flux 3 模型）。"
          },
          "aspect_ratio": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "21:9",
              "2:1",
              "16:9",
              "4:3",
              "1:1",
              "3:4",
              "9:16"
            ],
            "default": "auto",
            "description": "输出宽高比（所有 Flux 3 模型）。"
          },
          "sound": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "description": "是否生成音频（所有 Flux 3 模型）。"
          },
          "image_urls": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 2,
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "description": "源图像 URL（仅限 image-to-video 和 first-last-frame-to-video）。这些模型必填：flux-3/image-to-video 需提供恰好 1 张图像，flux-3/first-last-frame-to-video 需按顺序提供恰好 2 张图像。两张图像时，第 0 项为首帧，第 1 项为尾帧。",
            "example": [
              "https://example.com/start.png"
            ]
          },
          "video_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "源视频 URL（仅限 flux-3/extend-video，必填）。必须是 HTTP(S) MP4 文件，小于 50 MB 且短于 15 秒。",
            "example": "https://example.com/source.mp4"
          },
          "keyframes": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 10,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Keyframe"
            },
            "description": "定位参考图（仅限 flux-3/keyframes-to-video，必填）。提供 1–10 个关键帧，frame_index 值在 24 fps 时间轴上互不重复。"
          }
        }
      },
      "Keyframe": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "image_url",
          "frame_index"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "image_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "该关键帧的图像 URL（仅限 flux-3/keyframes-to-video，必填）。"
          },
          "frame_index": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "唯一的时间轴位置，取值 0 到 duration × 24（仅限 flux-3/keyframes-to-video，必填）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "SubmitResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 200,
            "enum": [200, 400, 401, 402, 403, 404, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503],
            "description": "业务状态码。`200` 表示成功，其他值都表示请求失败。请务必检查这个字段：部分参数校验错误会以 HTTP 200 返回，响应体里的 `code` 为 `400`。\n\n- `200`：成功\n- `400`：请求参数无效\n- `401`：API Key 缺失或无效\n- `402`：积分不足\n- `403`：没有权限\n- `404`：资源不存在\n- `408`：请求超时\n- `429`：请求频率超限\n- `500`：服务器内部错误\n- `502`：上游服务错误\n- `503`：服务暂不可用\n\n详见[错误码](/zh/api-manual/error-codes)。"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "task_id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "not_started",
                "enum": ["not_started", "running", "finished", "failed"],
                "description": "任务状态。提交后立即返回时始终为 `not_started`。后续状态请通过[查询任务状态](/zh/api-manual/task-management/status)接口或 `callback_url` 获取。\n\n- `not_started`：排队中，等待处理\n- `running`：生成中\n- `finished`：已完成，结果在 `files` 或 `output` 中\n- `failed`：失败，详情见 `error_message`"
              },
              "created_time": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "error"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 400,
            "enum": [200, 400, 401, 402, 403, 404, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503],
            "description": "业务状态码。`200` 表示成功，其他值都表示请求失败。请务必检查这个字段：部分参数校验错误会以 HTTP 200 返回，响应体里的 `code` 为 `400`。\n\n- `200`：成功\n- `400`：请求参数无效\n- `401`：API Key 缺失或无效\n- `402`：积分不足\n- `403`：没有权限\n- `404`：资源不存在\n- `408`：请求超时\n- `429`：请求频率超限\n- `500`：服务器内部错误\n- `502`：上游服务错误\n- `503`：服务暂不可用\n\n详见[错误码](/zh/api-manual/error-codes)。"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "message",
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "Invalid request parameters"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "invalid_request_error"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
